## Phase 4 — Shared foundations

Packages every WebUI will depend on. Must land before any surface migrates.

- **4.1 Design tokens** — Tailwind config + CSS variables extracted to `packages/shared/design-tokens/`. Every WebUI imports.
- **4.2 UI kit** — Radix wrappers, buttons, dialogs, toasts moved to `packages/shared/ui-kit/`.
- **4.3 Mojo TS bindings** — generated from `.mojom` files. Type-safe client for each region.
- **4.4 State transport** — Zustand store + Mojo fan-out adapter in `packages/shared/state/`. Hook API identical to today; transport is new. Unit-tested with N mock regions.
- **4.5 RPC client** — typed client for JSON-RPC methods, auto-generated from 3.3's registry. Drop-in replacement for `window.electronAPI.*`.
- **4.6 Dev harness** — Vite config that can serve a single region at `chrome://slayzone-<name>/` for fast iteration. Hot reload.
- **4.7 Shared test harness** — unified Vitest config for every WebUI + shared package. jsdom baseline for component tests; optional real-Chromium mode (launch actual dev binary, load region, drive via Mojo) for visual + integration tests. `rpc-client` tests live here; absorb the semantics previously covered by preload tests (3.10). Wire into CI.

**Phase 4 demo**: scratch region `chrome://slayzone-demo/` imports design tokens + ui-kit + state, renders a button that toggles a state atom mirrored to another scratch region — both live. Component tests run green under jsdom + Chromium mode.

**Exit**: all shared packages shipping under `packages/shared/`; demo regions prove state fan-out; dev harness reloads in < 200ms; shared test harness runs in CI on every PR.

