## Phase 6 — Inline tab widget

Real Chromium `WebContents` as a peer `views::WebView`. Eliminates the Electron `WebContentsView` overlay.

- **6.1 `TabStripModel` integration** — create/switch/close tabs via Mojo messages from the placeholder tabbar.
- **6.2 `WebContents` hosting** — `inline_tab_webview_->SetWebContents(active_tab)`. Layout parent drives size.
- **6.3 URL bar wiring** — placeholder browserchrome region sends URL → `tab->GetController().LoadURL(...)`; nav state broadcast back.
- **6.4 Extension event plumbing** — browser-wide session means MV2 + MV3 load automatically. Verify: 1Password, React DevTools, uBlock Origin.
- **6.5 Auth flow verification** — Google, GitHub, Microsoft, Apple SSO — each manually tested end-to-end.

**Phase 6 demo**: type a URL, watch a real web page render inline in the browser slot; install 1Password, unlock it; sign into Google.

**Exit**: four SSO flows pass; at least three major extensions work; rapid tab switch under 50 ms.

