## Phase 19 — Distribution

Ship signed binaries per-platform. Only runs end-to-end once Phases 1–18 ship a working app.

- **19.1 Mac universal `.dmg`** — `lipo` x64 + arm64; Developer ID + notarize + staple.
- **19.2 Windows installer** — WiX or NSIS, EV signing via Azure Key Vault.
- **19.3 Linux `.AppImage` + `.deb` + `.rpm`** — GPG signing; repo hosting on our CDN.
- **19.4 Update manifest** — signed JSON at CDN; sidecar checks on launch + interval.
- **19.5 Staged rollout** — 1% → 10% → 100% with health metrics gate.

**Exit**: all three OSes auto-update end-to-end from CI.

