# Continuous activities (run alongside phases, not gated)

Spun up the day the corresponding phase begins; never complete.

- **C1 Upstream merge bot** — rebase patches on new Chromium tags, CVE fast lane, LLM conflict resolution, `//content/` human gate. Starts day 1 of Phase 2.
- **C2 Parity ledger** — living spreadsheet: every `ipcMain.handle`, every component, every route. Starts day 1 of Phase 3.
- **C3 CI health** — flake tracking, build time, test duration; alerts on regression. Starts day 1 of Phase 1.
- **C4 Security review fleet** — dedicated agents audit each patch + each migrated surface for XSS, CSP, IPC trust boundaries. Starts day 1 of Phase 2.
- **C5 Test-coverage ledger** — one row per pre-migration test file (~97 + e2e + CLI). Columns: origin path, new path, runtime (electron/bun/chromium), status (passing / migrated / replaced / retired-with-reason). A surface/phase does not close until all its rows are non-`pending`. Starts day 1 of Phase 3.

